facetheory.lesser.json declares every key `lesser client install` reads.
  app_name=contentus version=0.0.1
  build=pnpm build (allowlisted in gov-infra/planning/contentus-pinned-repo-contract.json)
  server=build/server/handler.mjs export=handler
  assets=build/client
  paths resolve beneath the repository root; entry resolves beneath server.dir.
  every real path stays beneath its real base; no path escapes through a symlink.
